<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-003> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#description> "Owner's voice note after finishing Week 1 pickups: mentions a returning customer (Maria) requesting roast chicken, a new customer (Dave, referred by Maria) requesting something heartier, the soup selling out faster than expected, and a reminder to keep leaning into story-driven posts." .
<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-003> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#emotionalTone> "upbeat, encouraged" .
