<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-003> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#sourceReference> "Hey, quick one — just finished the pickups. So Maria came back again, and this time she brought her neighbor Dave and his daughter, first time ordering from us. That's exactly the word-of-mouth thing we want, so that's nice. Maria said she'd love a roast chicken next. And Dave said he wants something heartier now the weather's turning — fair, root veggies are everywhere right now anyway. Oh — and we sold out of the soup way faster than I thought, so let's make more this time. Also let's keep doing the little story behind each dish, that's what's actually working, way more than just posting 'this week's menu.' Keep it warm, simple, like always. Nothing fancy." .
