<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-004> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#description> "Bigger-batch roast chicken with root vegetables, made in response to Week 1 selling out and Maria's request. First week featuring a new customer relationship (Dave) gained through word-of-mouth referral." .
