<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-004> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#explainability> "Generated using Business Memory Asset v2 and Journey Ledger entry-003 (owner voice note). Dish choice (roast chicken) directly requested by keyPerson Maria T.; batch size increased in direct response to entry-002's lesson-learned (Week 1 batch was too small) and Dave's request for something heartier. seasonalContext ('menu shifts with seasonal ingredients') supports the shift toward root vegetables as weather turns colder. nextContentStrategy and successfulPattern ('story behind a dish... not just the dish itself') directly shaped the story-driven caption rather than a plain menu post. Caption checked against avoidPhrases — none used. This is also the first content piece generated after Business Memory Asset v1 evolved to v2 (new keyPeople: Maria, Dave)." .
